abstract: >-
  This repository contains the complete reproducibility artifact for the
  comparative evaluation of four ROS 2 deployment patterns (monolithic
  containers, microservices, dynamic module loading, overlay workspaces)
  on a K3s cluster pairing an NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin edge node with two
  amd64 cloud nodes. It includes the Dockerfiles for the five container
  images, the four Helm charts, the ROS 2 packages for the camera, YOLO,
  LLaVA and Voxtral nodes, the automated benchmark scripts, and the
  aggregated and raw measurement data of the multi-replicate campaign
  reported in the accompanying article.
